    "Copies everything MeatPad has stored — notes, snippets, commands, macros, themes, and window session — as plain files into a folder you choose." : {
      "comment" : "A description of the export functionality.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true,
      "localizations" : {
        "de" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Kopiert alles, was MeatPad gespeichert hat — Notizen, Snippets, Befehle, Makros, Themes und die Fenstersitzung — als einfache Dateien in einen von Ihnen gewählten Ordner."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copia todo lo que MeatPad ha guardado — notas, fragmentos, comandos, macros, temas y la sesión de ventanas — como archivos sencillos en una carpeta que tú elijas."
          }
        },
        "fr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copie tout ce que MeatPad a stocké — notes, extraits, commandes, macros, thèmes et la session de fenêtres — sous forme de fichiers simples dans un dossier de votre choix."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copia tutto ciò che MeatPad ha memorizzato — note, snippet, comandi, macro, temi e la sessione delle finestre — come file semplici in una cartella a tua scelta."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MeatPadが保存しているすべて — ノート、スニペット、コマンド、マクロ、テーマ、ウインドウセッション — を、選択したフォルダにプレーンなファイルとしてコピーします。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "MeatPad에 저장된 모든 것 — 메모, 스니펫, 명령, 매크로, 테마, 윈도우 세션 — 을 선택한 폴더에 일반 파일로 복사합니다."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Copia tudo o que o MeatPad armazenou — notas, snippets, comandos, macros, temas e a sessão de janelas — como arquivos simples em uma pasta escolhida por você."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 MeatPad 存储的所有内容——笔记、代码片段、命令、宏、主题和窗口会话——以纯文件的形式复制到你选择的文件夹中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
